Glacies left with her Frezae fairies for the Ice Palace and lured the Snow Lady out of the fortress.
While the ice queens fought, the Elemental Priestesses and the fairies Branwen and Herfies approached the source of the glacial river in the Ice Palace.
With the Quintessence's invocation, the glacial river's flow was stopped and the temperature began returning to normal.
The fight was intense, but the Snow Lady was distracted for an instant when she felt the Snowstorm Dragon being defeated by Kelvezu and falling into the sea again.
Glacies took advantage of it and defeated the Snow Lady.
With that chance, I locked the Snow Lady in the Magic Prison.

